@startuml
title Activity 22 - AI Assistant Query and Document Upload

|User|
start
:Open AI Assistant;
:Enter question or select workflow action;
if (Upload document?) then (yes)
  :Select file;
  |Frontend|
  :Validate type and size;
  :POST multipart upload;
  |Backend|
  :Store temporary file;
  :Extract text or image content;
  :Return document context;
endif
|Frontend|
:POST question with context;
|Backend|
:Authenticate request;
:Select configured main/sub-agent;
:Load relevant system context;
:Call AI provider;
if (Provider succeeds?) then (yes)
  :Return answer and suggested next action;
  |Frontend|
  :Render answer and sources;
else (no)
  :Return fallback error;
  |Frontend|
  :Show retry message;
endif
stop
@enduml
